    {
      "cn_text": "我们的心理健康其实并未消失;就像乌云遮蔽的太阳,它可能暂时从视野中隐去,但完全能够在瞬间得以恢复。",
      "en_text": "Our mental health doesn’t really go anywhere; like the sun behind a cloud, it can be temporarily hidden from view, but it is fully capable of being restored in an instant.",
      "id": 2016013264,
      "order_seq": "content_1_6",
      "task_id": 201601007,
