    {
      "cn_text": "它让我们能够以正确视角看待自己的生活——不把自己看得过重,能够自我解嘲,看到更宏大的图景,并相信事情终会顺利解决。",
      "en_text": "It allows us to have perspective on our lives — the ability to not take ourselves too seriously, to laugh at ourselves, to see the bigger picture, and to see that things will work out.",
